    <unit id="6" name="PageDescription">
      <segment>
        <source>Splash combines a compact branded surface, loading indicator, determinate progress, status copy, and optional footer. The service API can host it in a borderless startup window, while the visual control can be previewed directly in Gallery.</source>
      </segment>
    </unit>
